  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "两种编排风格",
      "items": [
        "SequentialWorkflow：addNode 线性链，依次执行；StateGraphWorkflow：节点+固定边+条件边的图，可循环（StateGraphWorkflow.java:96-120）",
        "maxSteps=0 不限步数；图在 resolveNext 返回 null 时终止，lastResult 即最终输出"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "路由优先级",
      "items": [
        "先匹配 conditionalEdges：StateRouter.route(ctx,req,res) → routeMap 映射到 nodeId；全部落空才走 transitions（:122-149）",
        "固定边可带 StateCondition.matches 守卫；outputText 自动成为下一节点的 input"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "节点复用 Agent",
      "items": [
        "RuntimeAgentNode.execute → session.run(request)：节点就是完整 Agent 循环（模型+工具+memory），不是简化调用（RuntimeAgentNode.java:14-24）",
        "WorkflowContext 跨节点共享 k/v 与 session；流式节点实现 WorkflowResultAware 才能拿到 lastResult"
      ]
    }
  ]
